<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Drinking His life from a living fountain.</l><l>Sweet water running inside of me.</l><l>Oh, how I love to live on the mountain,</l><l>Ever since Jesus set me free.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
